<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Visakhapatnam Cargoes - April 17.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Visakhapatnam Cargoes - April 17.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
